FILPAS   EQU   12                  PTR TO PASCAL FILE VARIABLE
FILBUF   EQU   16                  PTR TO I/O BUFFER
FILLIM   EQU   20                  OUTPUT LINES LIMIT FOR FILE
FILEND   EQU   24                  CURRENT BUFFER LENGTH (TEXTFILES)
